{
  "$toban": {
    "notes": [
      "このブロックはレンダリング時に取り除かれる。出力の /data/openclaw.json には残らない。",
      "",
      "perGuild はギルドごとに複製される雛形。使えるプレースホルダ:",
      "  {{label}} {{guildId}} {{treeId}} {{chainId}} {{agentId}} {{mcpServerId}}",
      "  {{allowUsers}} {{channels}}  ← 配列。値まるごとの置換なら配列のまま入る",
      "  {{mcpUrl}}       ← ギルドごとの Toban MCP エンドポイント",
      "",
      "配置先は src/render-config.ts が決める:",
      "  agent        -> agents.entries[{{agentId}}]",
      "  binding      -> multiAgent.bindings[]",
      "  mcpServer    -> mcp.servers[{{mcpServerId}}]",
      "  discordGuild -> channels.discord.guilds[{{guildId}}]",
      "",
      "!! 初回デプロイ前に `openclaw config schema` で検証すること。",
      "   OpenClaw の設定スキーマは本家の更新で変わる。ここが唯一のスキーマ定義なので、",
      "   キー名が変わったらこのファイルを直せば済む（TypeScript 側の修正は不要）。",
      "",
      "秘密情報は絶対に直書きしない。OpenClaw は ${ENV_VAR} を実行時に解決するので、",
      "MCP の Authorization ヘッダなどはそちらを使う。直書きは render-config が弾く。"
    ],
    "perGuild": {
      "agent": {
        "name": "Toban ({{label}})",
        "model": "anthropic/claude-opus-5",
        "workspace": "/data/workspace/{{label}}",
        "instructions": "/opt/toban/instructions/TOBAN.md"
      },
      "binding": {
        "agentId": "{{agentId}}",
        "match": {
          "channel": "discord",
          "guildId": "{{guildId}}"
        }
      },
      "mcpServer": {
        "url": "{{mcpUrl}}",
        "transport": "streamable-http",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer ${TOBAN_MCP_TOKEN}",
          "x-toban-guild-id": "{{guildId}}",
          "x-toban-chain-id": "{{chainId}}"
        },
        "requestTimeoutMs": 20000,
        "toolFilter": {
          "include": ["toban_*"]
        },
        "codex": {
          "agents": ["{{agentId}}"]
        }
      },
      "discordGuild": {
        "requireMention": true,
        "users": "{{allowUsers}}"
      }
    }
  },

  "channels": {
    "discord": {
      "groupPolicy": "allowlist",
      "dmPolicy": "allowlist",
      "allowFrom": [],
      "commands": {
        "native": false
      },
      "guilds": {}
    }
  },

  "agents": {
    "entries": {}
  },

  "multiAgent": {
    "mode": "routing",
    "bindings": []
  },

  "mcp": {
    "servers": {}
  }
}
